{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to SoundColors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple game of repetition and following the correct order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the pattern of sounds and colors, observe the buttons that light up, the order and repeat them to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete rounds and get to a higher level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the help or difficulty increase events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Numbers Event will help you with the order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Changes Event will complicate your memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your round record, complete the events to level up faster, but most importantly, learn and improve yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory is trained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*It is recommended to play in moderation, it can be difficult to play continuously.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534940?t=1741172837","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741172837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534940/ae527dc7de9e171f3b1ff4ecd36794d4acb7729a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741172837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534940/ae527dc7de9e171f3b1ff4ecd36794d4acb7729a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741172837","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3564120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to SoundColors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple game of repetition and following the correct order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the pattern of sounds and colors, observe the buttons that light up, t